echanic&nbsp;(Refrigeration and Air-Conditioner)/Process Plant Maintenance/Production &amp; Manufacturing/Refrigeration &amp; AC/Tool &amp; Die Maker &nbsp;(Press Tools, Jigs &amp; Fixtures)/Turner/Welder (Gas and Electric)</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>12</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width:108px\"><strong>&nbsp;2 Years</strong></td>\r\n			<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width:339px\"><strong>Candidate ITI/ITC Passed 02/03 Years with specified trade Or 12th passed with PCM.Obtained at least 35% marks in the aggregate.</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:40px; width:208px\"><strong>CIVIL ENGINEERING</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:380px\"><strong>Construction &amp; Wood Working/Draughtsman (Civil)/Surveyor</strong></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:70px\"><strong>12</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n',1);
