INSERT INTO `grievance` VALUES (20445,'Pramod sonkar ','22','2023','01MT211TH009','7755025295','pramodsonkar09@gamil.com','I had applied for my postgraduate degree online on 16th March 2026. However, I have not yet received my degree through courier. Two weeks ago, I contacted the Registrar’s Office, where I was informed that all formalities from their department had been completed and that the Academic Department is responsible for dispatching the degree. I also contacted the concerned staff member, but I was informed that due to pending work, my degree has not yet been sent. I humbly request you to kindly look into this matter and arrange to send my degree at the earliest. I reside approximately 500 km away from the university, and it is not feasible for me to visit the campus repeatedly. I shall be highly grateful for your prompt action in this regard. Thank you for your understanding.','2026-04-30 15:29:44');
