 to respond with pastoral and professional care.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Wi-Fi Facility</u></strong>&nbsp;: The college Campus&nbsp;is having high speed internet facility. The institute has a 24 X 7 Wi Fi facility in the college campus for the students and faculty members to avail internet connection at any place in the college.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Conference Center</u></strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Our Campus is provided with Air Conditioned Seminar Hall. This hall is fitted with permanent Audio, Video and Projection system. External Chief Guests are regularly invited to deliver and speak on various latest topics to our students so that &nbsp;our students are exposed to the recent Technology/Trends.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Hostel</u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;Facility&nbsp;</u></strong>: Our campus has separate hostels for boys and girls with all modern facilities, for boarding and other recreational activities. The hostels have their own mess to provide good and hygienic food to the students. Hostel accommodation will be provided on a first come first served basis.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Campus Radio</u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;Popcorn</u></strong>&nbsp;is the first campus Radio in state of Madhya Pradesh. The CRS broadcasts for 10 hours every day and primarily focuses on providing Information about educational opportunities and career guidance.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Sports &amp; fitness</u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;Zone</u></strong>&nbsp;serves as a vital and integral part of student life in campus. The mission of Sports &amp; Fitness is to provide the college with programmes that offer vigorous, fun-filled, health-promoting, physical activity conducive to wellness and personal development. Sports &amp; Fitness supports the mission of the college by seeking to create a climate that motivates members to embrace a healthy life-style, which can enhance their academic studies, build friendships and social skill, develop leadership qualities and cultivate a sense of ownership and belongingness to the college.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:source sans pro,sans-serif; font-size:16px\">In these contemporary times, sharp minds and healthy souls that are learned in both ways-academic-technical and management are a necessity. We at Bhabha have a time honored custom of nurturing young buds and blossom them into unwithering flowers, whose flagrance never fades. This salient task is executed by proficient hands, the management&rsquo;s faculty members and other staff associated with growth and commitment of this prestigious institution which has emerged as a shining star in realme of management education .in the field of management, and we use participative and interactive learning methodologies with industry interface and awarding degrees of MBA. They say, &lsquo;A journey of thousand miles begins with a single step &ldquo;needless to say, stepping in the right path is more important.</span></p>\r\n','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Master of Business Administration (MBA)&nbsp;-&nbsp;</strong>The MBA program has been designed as an intensive two year master&rsquo;s full time program aims to create a strong academic foundation to young thinking minds and provides the power to shape their thoughts and develop management aptitude.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">MBA - Intake -&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<p><u><strong>Specializations</strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students can choose&nbsp; any two of the following (except Hospital Management where the students are allowed to choose only one specialization for Hospital Management) in their Third Semester:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&middot;Marketing Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Retail Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Human Resources Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Financial Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Banking Financial Service Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Information Technology</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Hospital Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Production and Operation Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<ul>\r\n	<li>&middot;Marketing Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Retail Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Human Resources Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Financial Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Banking Financial Service Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Information Technology</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Hospital Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Production and Operation Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<ul>\r\n	<li>Sports</li>\r\n	<li>Community camp</li>\r\n	<li>Cultural programs</li>\r\n	<li>Scientific programs</li>\r\n	<li>NCC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<ul>\r\n	<li>HCL Technology</li>\r\n	<li>Reliance Money</li>\r\n	<li>ICICI prudential</li>\r\n	<li>HDFC Bank</li>\r\n	<li>IDBI Bank</li>\r\n	<li>Reliance Gen. Insurance</li>\r\n	<li>Tata sons</li>\r\n	<li>Maruti Suzuki</li>\r\n	<li>My first Boss</li>\r\n	<li>Satyam computer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',1);
INSERT INTO `institute` VALUES (28,4,'BHABHA ENGINEERING RESEARCH INSTITUTE ','<p><strong>Bhabha Engineering Research Institute ( BERI)&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:source sans pro,sans-serif; font-size:16px\">In these contemporary times, sharp minds and healthy souls that are learned in both ways-academic-technical and management are a necessity. We at Bhabha have a time honored custom of nurturing young buds and blossom them into unwithering flowers, whose flagrance never fades. This salient task is executed by proficient hands, the management&rsquo;s faculty members and other staff associated with growth and commitment of this prestigious institution which has emerged as a shining star in realme of management education .in the field of management, and we use participative and interactive learning methodologies with industry interface and awarding degrees of MBA. They say, &lsquo;A journey of thousand miles begins with a single step &ldquo;needless to say, stepping in the right path is more important.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>ACADEMIC GOALS</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Mastery of Management Theory</u></strong>:&nbsp;Gaining deep knowledge in functional areas like accounting, finance, marketing, and supply chain management.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Strategic &amp; Analytical Skills</u></strong>:&nbsp;Developing the ability to analyze complex data to solve business problems and evaluate strategies in a global environment.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Leadership &amp; Soft Skills:</u></strong>&nbsp;Nurturing managerial, communication and team-building skills required to lead organizations.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Ethical &amp; Responsible Leadership</u></strong>:&nbsp;Emphasizing integrity and sustainability in business decision-making.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Integration of Theory and Practice</u></strong>:&nbsp;Applying academic concepts through case studies, internships and live projects</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Facilities</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Transport</u></strong><strong><u>ation</u></strong>&nbsp;&ndash; A fulf-fledged Transport department functions in the college to provide transport facility to students and staff from the four corners of the city. This Service is offered ensuring a hassle-free and safe transportation.<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Mess</u></strong>&nbsp;&ndash; The College is providing Mess facility in the college premises to the students as well as teaching and non teaching staff of the college. The Mess is capable of catering the demands of the students and can accommodate 40 persons at a time. It has spacious &amp; properly maintained room as well as kitchen and provides Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Tea Canteen</u></strong> &ndash; The college is also having Tea Canteen in the college premises where the students and staff can have Tea, Snacks and other eatable items during the working hours.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Library</u></strong> &ndash; The college has a largest library facility where students can sit and read whatever books they want to read during the working hours .&nbsp;Students can also take the books to their homes as per the norms of the college library.&nbsp;College has been continuously enriching library in both ways (print as well as online) with big number of books and online resources. Digital library has been developed with the multi media roomespecially dedicated for online storage of web lectures, journals and e-content. The library is well maintained and is having spacious reading roomsavailable with reference to sections consisting of various journals, books, magazines and newspapers.&nbsp;The college library is computerized with software package which is an integrated Multi-user library management system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Health Care &amp; Medical Center</u></strong>&nbsp;&ndash; First Aid is the initial care of the ill or the injured. The college provides basic First Aid facilities and attempts to respond with pastoral and professional care.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Wi-Fi Facility</u></strong> : The college Campus&nbsp;is having high speed internet facility. The institute has a 24 X 7 Wi Fi facility in the college campus for the students and faculty members to avail internet connection at any place in the college.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Conference Center</u></strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Our Campus is provided with Air Conditioned Seminar Hall. This hall is fitted with permanent Audio, Video and Projection system. External Chief Guests are regularly invited to deliver and speak on various latest topics to our students so that &nbsp;our students are exposed to the recent Technology/Trends.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Hostel</u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;Facility </u></strong>: Our campus has separate hostels for boys and girls with all modern facilities, for boarding and other recreational activities. The hostels have their own mess to provide good and hygienic food to the students. Hostel accommodation will be provided on a first come first served basis.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Campus Radio</u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;Popcorn</u></strong> is the first campus Radio in state of Madhya Pradesh. The CRS broadcasts for 10 hours every day and primarily focuses on providing Information about educational opportunities and career guidance.</li>\r\n	<li><strong><u>Sports &amp; fitness</u></strong><strong><u> Zone</u></strong> serves as a vital and integral part of student life in campus. The mission of Sports &amp; Fitness is to provide the college with programmes that offer vigorous, fun-filled, health-promoting, physical activity conducive to wellness and personal development. Sports &amp; Fitness supports the mission of the college by seeking to create a climate that motivates members to embrace a healthy life-style, which can enhance their academic studies, build friendships and social skill, develop leadership qualities and cultivate a sense of ownership and belongingness to the college.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<p><strong>Bhabha Engineering Research Institute ( BERI) </strong>is one of the institutes of Bhabha Group of Institutes is a dynamic and rapidly growing educational group, widely recognized across Central India for delivering quality professional education. It serves as a hub of dedicated and experienced academicians committed to shaping the future of students through excellence in teaching and learning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The institute focuses on developing today&rsquo;s learners into competent, dynamic and versatile leaders of tomorrow. By offering professional programs in management studies, it aims to build a strong academic foundation and contribute to the growth and development of India in the 21st century.</p>\r\n','<p><strong>Master of Business Administration (MBA)&nbsp;- </strong>The MBA program has been designed as an intensive two year master&rsquo;s full time program aims to create a strong academic foundation to young thinking minds and provides the power to shape their thoughts and develop management aptitude.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Intake - 60</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Ph.D. in Management </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is&nbsp;a research-intensive doctoral program (typically 3&ndash;5 years) designed to prepare candidates for careers in academia, research or top-level consulting by focusing on advanced business theories and methodologies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<p><u><strong>Specializations</strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students can choose&nbsp; any two of the following (except Hospital Management where the students are allowed to choose only one specialization for Hospital Management) in their Third Semester:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&middot;Marketing Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Retail Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Human Resources Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Financial Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Banking Financial Service Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Information Technology</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Hospital Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Production and Operation Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<ul>\r\n	<li>&middot;Marketing Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Retail Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Human Resources Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Financial Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Banking Financial Service Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Information Technology</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Hospital Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;Production and Operation Management</li>\r\n	<li>&middot;International Business</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Sports</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Community Camp</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Cultural Programs</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Scientific Programs</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sports</li>\r\n	<li>Community Camp</li>\r\n	<li>Cultural Programs</li>\r\n	<li>Scientific Programs</li>\r\n	<li>NCC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<p><strong><u>Placed Students</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Internship Hub</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>HCL Technology</li>\r\n	<li>Reliance Money</li>\r\n	<li>ICICI Prudential</li>\r\n	<li>HDFC Bank</li>\r\n	<li>IDBI Bank</li>\r\n	<li>Reliance General Insurance</li>\r\n	<li>Tata Sons</li>\r\n	<li>Maruti Suzuki</li>\r\n	<li>My First Boss</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',1);
INSERT INTO `institute` VALUES (29,2,'College of Pharmacy, Bhabha University, Bhopal','<div style=\"margin-left:.4in;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">WELCOME MESSAGE</span></strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The College of Pharmacy warmly welcomes you all to a journey of learning guided by high vision and standards. Our aim is to provide quality education that ensures the overall development of students through a 360-degree learning approach. This approach covers key areas such as personality development, skill development, entrepreneurship development, life-skill enrichment courses, and value-added programs.</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Established in 2023, the College of Pharmacy is an emerging institute in the field of pharmacy education and research. The institute offers opportunities for product development through its Entrepreneurship Cell, which consists of expert faculty and an enthusiastic team of students. Several products developed by the institute are showcased and distributed through fairs and university events.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>By choosing the College of Pharmacy, you will gain not only expertise in the field of medicines but also essential life-enrichment skills that will support your personal and professional growth.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a2569b6b6a3ef5a5b2aa2e9aaa0b8047.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:0px; float:left; height:350px; margin:2px; width:450px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">COLLEGE OF PHARMACY</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>(Recognized by Govt. of Madhya Pradesh,</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Affiliated to Bhabha University, Bhopal &amp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>Approved by PCI, New Delhi).</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Address: NH -12, Hoshangabad Road, Jatkhedi.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Bhopal-462026 M.P. INDIA.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Email:- collegeofpharmacybhabha@gmail.com,&nbsp;</strong><strong>bhabhauniversitybpl@gmail.com</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Phone No.: 0755 - 4246498, 9039921140, 9827456734</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:.4in;\"><br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/ea5ecc76045cf3faebd7b40f4cfb0f17.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:3px; float:left; height:263px; margin:5px; width:315px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">&nbsp;Prof. (Dr.) Shailesh Kumar Ghatuary</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">&nbsp;M.Pharm, Ph.D, D.Sc</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to the College of Pharmacy, Bhabha University. Since its origin in 2003 as the Bhabha Group of Institutions and its establishment as a University in 2018, our institution has been committed to excellence in education, research, and innovation under the aegis of Ayushmati Education and Social Society. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Our College of Pharmacy is dedicated to nurturing skilled, ethical, and responsible healthcare professionals. We offer B.Pharm and D.Pharm programs designed to build strong academic foundations while emphasizing practical learning and real-world exposure. With modern infrastructure, well-equipped laboratories, and a peaceful green campus, we provide an environment that supports both academic growth and personal development. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>We believe that true education extends beyond textbooks. Through hands-on training, industry interaction, and research opportunities, we prepare our students to excel in hospitals, pharmaceutical industries, community practice, and research fields. Our experienced faculty members continuously guide and inspire students to think critically, innovate, and serve society with dedication. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>At our core, we aim to develop professionals who not only succeed in their careers but also contribute meaningfully to healthcare and society. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>I warmly invite you to join us and become part of a learning community that strives for excellence and service to humanity. Prof. (Dr.) Sailesh Kumar Ghatuary Principal College of Pharmacy Bhabha University, Bhopal&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<!--\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a8567e8997a7bd96767c563e4ee4a58c.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:145px; width:140px\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong>Principal, </strong><br />\r\n<strong>Dr. Surendra Kumar Patsariya</strong></p> \r\n-->\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222\">VISION</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"Vision\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/17223cbcf6cd4a446fc6efb02d028581.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:75px; margin:2px; width:80px\" />Pharmacists are established as medicines experts, leaders in health promotion, and disease prevention, providing individually tailored medicines.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222\">MISSION</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"MISSION\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/d6108aa58316a4d3eafc8c0207c4f25d.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:75px; margin:2px; width:80px\" />To optimize public health through safe, effective, and rational medicine use, patient counseling, and pharmaceutical care, upholding high ethical standards.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222\">PROGRAM OUTCOMES</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"COP course outcomes\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1e1722bdc8548cca656552265966693c.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:75px; margin:2px; width:80px\" />The curriculum is designed to produce professionals with the following competencies: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Pharmacy Council of India. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Pharmacy Knowledge: Deep understanding of core pharmaceutical sciences (Chemistry, Pharmaceutics, Pharmacology, Pharmacognosy). </strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Patient Care &amp; Counseling: Ability to review prescriptions, dispense medicines, and provide patient education (essential for community/hospital pharmacy). </strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Analytical &amp; Technical Skills: Proficiency in analytical techniques, drug design, and modern analytical instrumentation. </strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Ethical Practice: Understanding legal, safety, and ethical requirements (Drug &amp; Cosmetics Act). </strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Leadership &amp; Lifelong Learning: Ability to lead, manage, and adapt to new technologies and research.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"COP CAMPUS DETAILS\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/6009e638d8fe8740cd7f8a58b27b69ca.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:250px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" /></strong><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">CAMPUS DETAILS</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>The campus is situated at NH-12 Hoshangabad Road, Jatkhedi, Bhopal. It is around 15 km from bhopal railway station. The specialties of the campous includes: A huge campus of 27 acres. Lush Green pollution free surrounding Hostel facility with modern amenities Hygienic and nutritious food Housekeeping facility 24X7 medical facility Security with modern gadgets and arms Cafeteria.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"COP Library\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/ad693190bb8271cc67569bdba74f207e.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:250px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">LIBRARY</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Library is the source of the knowledge and its work as soul of the institute. Large number of books available in our library inclulde Indian Pharmacopoeia, British Pharmacopeia, Indian &amp; International Journals. Besides periodicals and reference we keep the students upto date with the latest digital libarary that includes CDs, audio-visulas , Internet section, reprographic section.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"HG TF\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/bb9161b38e31b069496f732732f9f711.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:250px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" /></strong><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">HERBAL GARDEN &amp; TRANSPORT FACILITY</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Key Features of Pharmacy Herbal Gardens:</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Species Diversity: Gardens typically house a wide variety of medicinal herbs, shrubs, and trees (e.g., Terminalia arjuna, Saraca asoca, Datura metel).</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Educational Purpose: These spaces support practical training for B.Pharm and M.Pharm students, focusing on herbal drug technology and natural product research.</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Specialized Areas: Some gardens feature thematic sections like Navagrah Vatika, Nakshatra Vatika, and aquatic plant ponds.</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Infrastructure: Gardens are frequently equipped with greenhouses, shade houses, and drip irrigation systems to ensure optimal growth of rare or sensitive species.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/b5bd78f037fb43c27540a52033fad6e6.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; float:left; height:250px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" /><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">OUR KEY FACULTY</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Key Faculty Focus Areas &amp; Credentials</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Across these institutions, the key faculty members are recognized for:</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Specializations: Pharmaceutics, Pharmacology, Pharmaceutical Analysis, Quality Assurance.</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Qualifications: Most key faculty hold Ph.D. degrees or are pursuing them, with M.Pharm backgrounds.</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Research &amp; Industry Focus: Faculty members focus on drug development, clinical trials, and research-driven pedagogy, often with industry-aligned experience.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Diploma in Pharmacy (D.Pharm.)</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2 Years Full- Time Diploma Course in Pharmacy intake 60 Students.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Bachelor in Pharmacy (B.Pharm.) </span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>4 Years full-time degree course in Pharmacy intake 60 Students.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Passing 10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB) or Mathematics (PCM) as core subjects, with an aggregate score of 50% or higher (45%&ndash;50% for reserved categories). Candidates must be at least 17 years old. Eligibility for Direct II Year B.Pharm Course through lateral entry for D.Pharma holder For Diploma holders passed qualifying examination from a PCI approved institution with at least 50% ( 45% in case of candidate belonging to reserved category. Admission Procedure: Admission based on 12th class (PCB/PCM) marks merits.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Eligibility for Direct II Year B.Pharm Course through lateral entry for D.Pharma holder</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>For Diploma holders passed qualifying examination from a PCI approved institution with at least 50% ( 45% in case of candidate belonging to reserved category. Admission Procedure: Admission based on 12th class (PCB/PCM) marks merits.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">ANTI-RAGGING CAMPUS</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Anti-ragging is a disturbing reality in the higher education system of our country. Despite the fact that over the years ragging has claimed hundreds of innocent lives and has ruined careers of thousands of bright students, the practice is still perceived by many as a way of &quot;familiarization&quot; and an &quot;initiation into the real world&quot; for young college going students. Other organisations/bodies working in this field have also attempted to define ragging, the variety of definitions being reflective of differences in perspective.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">ANTI-RAGGING CAMPUS</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>College of Pharmacy have Anti-ragging committee the fallowing staff are the members of the Anti ragging committee.</strong></p>\r\n','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Bachelor of Pharmacy&nbsp;<br />\r\nDiploma of Pharmacy</strong></p>\r\n','<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Smart Class Room / Pharmaceutical Laboratory</span></strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"Smart classroom labs college of pharmacy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a0cc2cb4621e50840b6e99aa6bdb19f7.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:0px; float:left; height:450px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" />The class rooms are subject specific and along with the overhead and LCD projector facility. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The institution also has tutorial rooms for the standards who require extra lectures. </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Laboratories Pharmaceutics-I </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmaceutics-II </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Chemistry-I </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Chemistry-II </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmacology </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmacognosy </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Anatomy Physiology&nbsp;</strong><strong>and</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pathophysiology </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Microbiology and </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Biochemistry </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Machine Room </strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Central Instrumentation Room.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<!-- <p> </p> --><!--\r\n<p> <strong>Library</strong> </p>\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/3cddca982a97877538fb55dc78ff4cb3.jpg\" style=\"height:281px; width:500px\" /></p>\r\n--><!--\r\n<p> <strong>Approvals</strong> </p>\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"#\" style=\"height:; width:\" /></p>\r\n--><!--\r\n<p> <strong>Affiliation</strong> </p>\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"#\" style=\"height:; width:\" /></p>\r\n-->','<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">INSTITUTION INNOVATIVE CELL AND EENTREPRENEURSHIP DEVELOPMENT CELL &amp; PRODUCT DEVLOPMENT</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"IIC EDC\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/95b8189c95d12e5668b1dad767221d06.png\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:0px; float:left; height:250px; margin:5px 10px; width:350px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>Bhabha University Bhopal have a institution innovative Cell and Eentrepreneurship Development Cell which facilitate students for Product Development and many Products Developed by students through under the Guidance of Expert faculty members.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">WORLD PHARMACIST DAY&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/0d930c53826ac15476a5a90fcccd4dba.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5031db286bf07b0f681de2ea8eca0ebc.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">NATIONAL PHARMACY WEEK&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/652d673de51056b3fc1e2e3dfd464e72.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">PHARMACOVIGILANCE DAY</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/bcecc4823d3a34f7e8db52f028bfa9e9.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:3px; float:left; height:300px; margin:5px 1px; width:400px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>The Placement Cell of Bhabha University, Bhopal plays a crucial role in locating job opportunities for Under Graduates and Post Graduates passing out from the college by keeping in touch with reputed firms and industrial establishments. The Placement Cell operates round the year to facilitate contacts between companies and graduates. The number of students placed through the campus interviews is continuously rising. On invitation, many reputed industries visit the institute to conduct interviews.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>We have been successful in maintaining our high placement statistics over the years and the fact that our students bear the recession blues with record breaking placements itself is a testimony to our quality. Our ingenious alumnae have set new standards in the corporate world through their estimable contributions and University is confident that it &nbsp;will continue that legacy in the years to come.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><strong>The Placement Cell organizes career guidance programmes for all the students starting from first year. The cell arranges training programmes like Mock Interviews, Group Discussions, Communication Skills Workshop etc and it also organizes Public Sector Exam Training for students who are interested to join Government Sectors. It also invites HR Managers from different industries to conduct training programmes for final year students.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">SPORTS FACILITY</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8c0d948a9c7adde2cbda1422e80cda43.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/40330c5261a6b2a33d5d63cbaec64b8f.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/7b46c0514c0a95d926a54a5c35da6c63.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">STUDENT CLUBS</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1e42765b2c45f7c719e12985e7ac7e18.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/b99ac3960c49766e11f9c6eea8588e31.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8632a8fbe95977d2d19ba285f4077358.jpeg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:250px; margin:5px; width:350px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">COMMITTEE</span></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">ANTI-RAGGING COMMITTEE</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/fa4c773ca2421b81358c9ff2a5e7967b.pdf\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Download</span></strong></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">GENDER SENSITIZATION CELL</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8b5ab65288ecf0c46af393b9c16712a3.pdf\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Download</span></strong></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">CAREER GUIDANCE CELL</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/2b5ff130952ddb70f808e72b910d8197.pdf\"><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Download</span></strong></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">APPROVALS / AFFILIATION / REGISTRATION / MOU</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:100%px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">PCI APPROVAL LETTER</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5506196867924721e6b1b83485fcb386.pdf\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">Download</span></strong></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">UNIVERSITY AFFILIATION</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">Download</span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222\">IIC ESTABLISHMENT CERTIFICATE</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/539ff6af9fe15a1c4746c2dc12aa2306.pdf\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">Download</span></strong></a></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 34, 34)\">OUR ALUMNI</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5a0ef55e7e8a9b91c0b3b57f04eab374.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:300px; margin:5px; width:1000px\" /></p>\r\n',1);
INSERT INTO `institute` VALUES (30,16,'BHABHA HOMOEOPATHIC COLLEGE AND HOSPITAL (Proposed)','<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bhmch.in\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><img src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/6922d10c4a182131bad863d95a4b7010.gif\" />BHMCH.IN<img src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/6922d10c4a182131bad863d95a4b7010.gif\" /></span></a></strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Bhabha Homoeopathic College &amp; Hospital\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8984dc105ffb4faa7e58d39bd4e7def1.jpeg\" style=\"height:314px; width:700px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bhabha University (Bhabha Homoeopathic College &amp; Hospital) is committed to academic excellence. We offer a wide variety of courses and materials to students. We are an educational institution where students will find many challenging opportunities that enhance their knowledge. We have proven that by providing the best industry-based education and imparting practical knowledge to students, we can set ourselves high standards. We wish all students success in life and future careers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Mission homoeopathy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/cc3aaa9551b0966e2ac980fc7875cf79.jpg\" style=\"height:170px; width:193px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mission</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>To create competent, compassionate, Homoeopath who uphold the highest ideal cure and serve society with integrity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Vision Homoeo\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/f5e7a36621be7e0233d41304aab3401e.jpg\" style=\"height:170px; width:193px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Vision</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A healthier &nbsp;society where gentle individualised Free from side effects healing is accessible to all.</p>\r\n','<p>This is a wonderful opportunity to be part of an excellent educational organization, Bhabha University (Bhabha Homeopathic College and Hospital).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A hearty welcome, I want to tell you</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Students and staff of Bhabha University (Bhabha Le Homeopathic College and Hospital)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Homeopathy: Gentle treatment for a healthy society. For over 200 years, homeopathy has stood on one simple truth: the body heals itself. At when we given the right stimulus, Homeopathy focuses on the root cause of disease rather than suppressing symptoms. The aim of homeopathy is to restore balance so that disease does not continue to progress.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Homeopathy is a very cost-effective and sustainable treatment method; it is very safe for both patients and the environment. Homeopathy is very affordable and sustainable remedy Homoeopathy healing that is highest ideal cure which is rapidly, gently and permanent restoration of health.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/9fa837eb7f19422114dceb6edb4d56fa.jpg\" style=\"border-style:solid; border-width:1px; height:279px; width:200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dr. Ahmed Dad Khan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; BHMS, MD (Homoeo)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Principal</p>\r\n','<p><strong>BHMS</strong> (Bachelor of Homeopathy Medicine and Surgery)</p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:0px solid black; height:1px; width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"text-align:justify\">This is a five-and-a-half-year, undergraduate academic degree program that includes a mandatory one year rotatory internship in homoeopathic hospital that trains students to become licensed medical practitioners in homeopathy.</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><img alt=\"BHMS images\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/46964229b660a7f16d0ce732c894e9dc.jpg\" style=\"height:100px; width:300px\" /></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','<p>Bachelor of Homeopathy Medicine and Surgery</p>\r\n','<p><strong>Departments (First year to Final year )</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Anatomy</li>\r\n	<li>Physiology and Biochemistry</li>\r\n	<li>Homeopathic Pharmacy</li>\r\n	<li>Homeopathic Materia Medica</li>\r\n	<li>Repertories and Case taking</li>\r\n	<li>Organon of Medicine</li>\r\n	<li>Forensic Medicine Toxicology</li>\r\n	<li>Pathology &amp; Microbiology</li>\r\n	<li>Surgery</li>\r\n	<li>Obstetrics /Gynaecology</li>\r\n	<li>Practice of Medicine</li>\r\n	<li>Community Medicine &amp; Research Methodology</li>\r\n	<li>Yoga &amp; Physiotherapy</li>\r\n	<li>Medical Education Technology Unit</li>\r\n	<li>Skills Labs</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pharmacy Lab</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Lab1\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/2a7fdce1f7f3ac0431def1d879cf9e82.jpg\" style=\"height:320px; width:450px\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"Lab 2\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/e000469785e3236f6b92ccb9a44ba1de.jpg\" style=\"height:320px; width:450px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Lab 3\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/5ad38f936845ce6bd4f99db2cb57de10.jpg\" style=\"height:320px; width:450px\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"Lab 4\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/d475d57e4792df11b936b0694f24821b.jpg\" style=\"height:320px; width:450px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>X-Ray Room</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"X Ray Machine\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/452c9c12f9ef95bf28173c751c2ff9a4.jpg\" style=\"height:407px; width:250px\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"X ray room homoeopathy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8b80b3915bfdbbaa75a685f88e59e01e.jpg\" style=\"height:407px; width:497px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>METU</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/62085b38b1b9248646373387943f6e5f.jpg\" style=\"height:274px; width:400px\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"Metu computer\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/fe81151ad20e49aaf0c38902f21b9956.jpg\" style=\"height:274px; width:400px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operation Theater Room</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"OT machine Homoeopath\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/338c81f59c6adfcd4d0182ac12339e25.jpg\" style=\"height:266px; width:400px\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"Operation Theater room\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/1af30e3a900647c65c49a700cf8f135a.jpg\" style=\"height:266px; width:400px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Emergency Room, Stature, WheelChair</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"Emergency room Homoeopathy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/8a18eddbd76e07988e338fb5b666c4e7.jpg\" style=\"height:266px; width:400px\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"OPD Stature Homoeopathy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/a6b5f7db9f556fb5bd532e33af6e32b3.jpg\" style=\"height:266px; width:400px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Labor Room and OT Room</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"Labor room &amp; OT room\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/66cb0a95699ed62f2e2e11ede670343c.jpg\" style=\"height:366px; width:800px\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>OPD Timing ( 9:30AM - 04:00PM )</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><img alt=\"OPD timing Homoeopathy\" src=\"https://www.bhabhauniversity.edu.in/upload/media/868b25fc39eb4c7a53900a843adef4e6.jpeg\" style=\"height:314px; width:700px\" /></strong></p>\r\n','<p><strong>Academic Activities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Daily lecture &amp;Tutorials</li>\r\n	<li>Practical Cases</li>\r\n	<li>Case-Taking Sessions</li>\r\n	<li>Repertrisation Practice Seminars and Presentations</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Clinical Activities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>OPD &amp; IPD Duties</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Rural Health Camp</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;School Health Programs</li>\r\n	<li>Maternal and Child Health Check-up, Homeopathy managements</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Co-curricular Activities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Quiz Competitions</li>\r\n	<li>CME and Guest Lectures</li>\r\n	<li>Journal Club</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n','<ol>\r\n	<li>Bhabha Homeopathic College Hospital always assists with placements.</li>\r\n	<li>Campus interviews for chain clinics in the private sector, NGOs Wellness, Wellness centre, and</li>\r\n	<li>Medical Claim Analyst for AYUSH, advisor in TPA, Insurance firms, etc.</li>\r\n	<li>Practice in the UK, VAE, Europe, and Canada. Needs&nbsp; specific licensing.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n',1);
INSERT INTO `institute` VALUES (31,5,'Department of Computer Application','<p style=\"text-align:justify\">The Department of Computer Application offers Under graduate Degree Course, post Graduate Diploma, Diploma Certificate Course.&nbsp;We prepare graduates for careers in both product-based and service-based companies, empowering them to create positive change in the world. Graduates are well-equipped to become professionals or entrepreneurs, contributing significantly to the economy.<br />\r\nWe collaborate with IT industry partners to ensure our courses cover trending areas such as Data Science &amp; Artificial Intelligence, cloud computing, Cyber Security, Animation &amp; Gaming, and Full Stack Development etc. Our programs are designed with input from industry experts, providing students with practical experience and making them job-ready.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>To provide students with a comprehensive understanding of computer applications and their practical use in the business world.</li>\r\n	<li>To equip students with the knowledge and skills necessary to design, develop, and implement computer applications and systems.</li>\r\n	<li>To enhance students&#39; problem-solving, critical thinking, and analytical skills.</li>\r\n	<li>To prepare students for careers in the IT industry and other related fields.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black; font-family:times new roman,serif; font-size:12pt\">This School is established to bridge the digital divide and to strengthen the foundation of the knowledge society in a world that is progressing rapidly in technological development. The school focuses on imparting the knowledge of various specialized domains of computer science and information technology inclusive of theoretical knowledge and practical skills.</span></p>\r\n','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:black\">UG Programmes</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:black\">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Post Graduate Diploma Programmes</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:black\">Post Graduate Diploma in Computer Applications (PGDCA)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:black\">Diploma Programmes</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:black\">Diploma in Computer Applications (DCA)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:.5in;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n','<p>Bachelor of Computer Applications</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Master of Computer Applications</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Diploma in Computer Applications</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Post Graduate Diploma in Computer Applications</p>\r\n','<p><strong>Programmes Offered</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>UG Program</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BACHELOR OF&nbsp; COMPUTER APPLICATIONS&nbsp;</strong><strong>(BCA) </strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\">UNDER NEP-2020 WITH MAJOR AND&nbsp;MINOR</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bachelor&nbsp; of&nbsp; Computer Applications&nbsp; (<strong>BCA</strong>) is a 3 Year undergraduate&nbsp; degree&nbsp;<strong>course</strong>&nbsp;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This&nbsp;<strong>course</strong>&nbsp;provides a lot of opportunities to the students who are interested in computer field and wants to work in the IT sector as programmer or software developer. It is a technical degree that prepares students for a career in the field of computer applications and software development. The basic course curriculum of BCA typically&nbsp; emphasis on database management systems, operating systems, &nbsp;computer architecture, web technology and languages such as&nbsp;C,C++, Python, HTML, Java,&nbsp; R Programming, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:32px; width:76px\">\r\n			<p><strong>COURSE</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:32px; width:59px\">\r\n			<p><strong>SEATS</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:32px; width:97px\">\r\n			<p><strong>DURATION</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:32px; width:386px\">\r\n			<p><strong>ELIGIBILITY</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:71px; width:76px\">\r\n			<p><strong>BCA</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:71px; width:59px\">\r\n			<p><strong>60</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:71px; width:97px\">\r\n			<p><strong>&nbsp;03 Years</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:71px; width:386px\">\r\n			<p><strong>A candidate should have passed Senior Secondary Examination on the pattern of 10+2 a recognized Board of Education or an equivalent examination recognized as equivalent there to by the University.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#333333; font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:10.0pt\">FUTURE SCOPE OF BCA</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The scope for pursuing BCA can be highly beneficial in terms of building up a professional career in IT MNC&rsquo;s. As this is one of the most in demand platforms and opens up one&rsquo;s career from multiple angles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MAJOR JOB PROFILE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;System Engineer</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Software Tester</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Software Developer&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Programmer Analyst</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Cloud Engineer&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Cloud Administrator</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Cloud Architect</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>POST GRADUATE DIPLOMA IN COMPUTER APPLICATIONS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a one-year postgraduate program that provides students with a comprehensive understanding of computer applications and their practical use in the business world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Post Graduate Diploma in Computer Application program covers topics such as programming, database management, web development, networking, and software engineering. It is a popular course for those who want to enter the IT industry or enhance their existing knowledge in the field.</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:84px\">\r\n			<p><strong>COURSE</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:63px\">\r\n			<p><strong>SEATS</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:98px\">\r\n			<p><strong>DURATION</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:415px\">\r\n			<p><strong>ELIGIBILITY</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:84px\">\r\n			<p><strong>PGDCA</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:63px\">\r\n			<p><strong>100</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:98px\">\r\n			<p><strong>&nbsp;01 Year</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:415px\">\r\n			<p><strong>Graduation Passed Any Stream</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#333333; font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:10.0pt\">CAREER OPPORTUNITY AFTER PGDCA</span></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>PGDCA has a wide range of applications in jobs. Every industrial company has a significant number of designations with a high PGDCA income, despite the fact that the bulk of employment is located in the IT sector. After PGDCA career are following :</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Software Development</li>\r\n	<li>Database Administration</li>\r\n	<li>System Analysis</li>\r\n	<li>Network Administration&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Web Development&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Cybersecurity&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>IT Consulting&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Project Management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>DIPLOMA IN COMPUTER APPLICATIONS</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Diploma in Computer Applications is a one-year diploma program that aims to make students study computer applications in depth in a shorter period of time.The DCA program imparts scientific, practical and technical knowledge to its learners about various computer tools that are used in day to day life.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>The main objective of DCA is to provide an in depth knowledge in computers by touching the subjects like microsoft tools, operating systems, aspects of internet and other relevant topics.</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:107px\">\r\n			<p><strong>COURSE</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:85px\">\r\n			<p><strong>SEATS</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:132px\">\r\n			<p><strong>DURATION</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:36px; width:708px\">\r\n			<p><strong>ELIGIBILITY</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:107px\">\r\n			<p><strong>DCA</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:85px\">\r\n			<p><strong>100</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:132px\">\r\n			<p><strong>&nbsp;01 Year</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"height:43px; width:708px\">\r\n			<p><strong>12th Passed Any Stream.</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">CAREER OPPORTUNITY AFTER DCA</span></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<h4>On completion of this course, some of the most popular career options for students are:</h4>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:13.6pt\">&middot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Computer Operator</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:13.6pt\">&middot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Web Designer</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:13.6pt\">&middot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Accountant</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:13.6pt\">&middot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Software Developer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;C++ developer</p>\r\n','','<p><strong>Major Job Profile</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>System Engineer</li>\r\n	<li>Software Tester</li>\r\n	<li>Software Developer</li>\r\n	<li>Programmer Analyst</li>\r\n	<li>Cloud Engineer</li>\r\n	<li>Cloud Administrator</li>\r\n	<li>Cloud Architect</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',1);
